Subject: [PATCH 2/7] passthrough: Factor out CachePolicy::timeout() and
 open_options()

Move the mapping from cache policy to entry/attribute timeout (main.rs)
and to FOPEN_* flags (open, opendir, create) into methods on
CachePolicy.  No change in behaviour.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
